# Recursion and many small calls.
to fib n
    if n is less than 2
        return n
    .
    one is n minus 1
    two is n minus 2
    left is fib one
    right is fib two
    return left plus right
.
to square x
    return x times x
.
say fib 20
sum is 0
count from 1 to 20000 as i
    squared is square i
    sum is sum plus squared
.
say sum
